  "ERC4626Wrap_sGHO": {
    "enabled": true,
    "$comment": "Aave sGHO savings vault (ERC-4626). sGHO.asset() returns GHO; convertToAssets unwraps shares to GHO-equivalent. Held by the Alpha funds. At fork block 25230126, redeem() returned exactly convertToAssets() (no exit fee/cooldown), so convertToAssets does not over-report. Share price is >= 1 GHO (yield vault), not a 1:1 share/asset peg."
  },
  "ERC4626Wrap_waEthLidoGHO": {
    "enabled": true,
    "$comment": "Aave V3 Lido instance stata-token wrap of aEthLidoGHO. waEthLidoGHO.asset() returns GHO; convertToAssets unwraps shares to GHO-equivalent. ACCOUNT_11 holds ~$233 of this token. Production adapter not deployed yet \u2014 integration test deploys it ephemerally from this config block. Run script/deploy/04_DeployBalanceAdapters.s.sol post-PR-merge to deploy and write the address back into `deployed`."
  },
